{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"loja":{"host":"3dcfaf62","siblings":["d2f323a0"]},"igual":{"host":"1d010af2","siblings":["ebd6f3fd"]}},"rows":{"d2f323a0":{"word":"lojas","rank":4443,"meanings":[{"headword":"loja","pos":"noun","source_reference":"kaikki:en-loja-pt-noun-TfS~Xape","translation":"shop, store"}]},"ebd6f3fd":{"word":"iguais","rank":2475,"meanings":[{"headword":"igual","pos":"adj","source_reference":"kaikki:en-igual-pt-adj--dbNHtXP","translation":"equal"}]}},"examples":{"d2f323a0":{"m":[[{"t":"Temos que correr, ou as lojas vão fechar.","e":"We have to hurry, or the stores will close.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.871915,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"84cf1d041c03c46970d4f9cecdc6fc0f","i":"1b546e85756abb1dee859b0abd110b40","r":"11144590:9004520","c":"MrJuice","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11144590","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11144590","b":"Tatoeba sentence #11144590 by MrJuice; English translation #9004520 by mccarras","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11144590","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu não gosto mesmo das lojas de lá.","e":"I don't really like the stores there.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.940466,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"d30435eaeeb9603cefcbc6e99e3d6a03","i":"567d041ee9e81c0a76b84b996d196d46","r":"1862531:31122","c":"gleydin","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1862531","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1862531","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1862531 by gleydin; English translation #31122 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1862531","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Podemos procurar em todas as lojas e casas nesta rota.","e":"We could canvass all the shops and homes along this route.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.868454,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"87463f371485630d009cbaa9a3fa1707","i":"642554928d4fba89d38a686b715d9913","r":"6391984:6902824:203:5097070","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6391984","6902824","203"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Haveria uma corrida às lojas, mas as lojas talvez nem estivessem a funcionar.","e":"Your credit card's not going to work at the store. There'd be absolutely mass panic.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.428939,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"68f26c386a24227c560c6959dd1d713b","i":"b30a9a9162e594b0f6ee7e120f2fc45f","r":"6493214:7029442:275:5147693","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6493214","7029442","275"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Há muitas lojas caras ao longo da avenida.","e":"There are many expensive shops along the avenue.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.905491,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"1e908f9b2e4d990006a4a13fbec35c8d","i":"323faef7c5c5ae179dd399ac1c207188","r":"11312420:11312402","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11312420","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11312420","b":"Tatoeba sentence #11312420 by carlosalberto; English translation #11312402 by carlosalberto","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11312420","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Também falaram com alguns donos de lojas na zona.","e":"Yeah, they also spoke to a couple other business owners in the area.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.774404,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b4887b770c9ce7f9fb676065d36a7f11","i":"dcb3c51a3031e4fcd49375824cb439c2","r":"5198026:6415437:560:2193669","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5198026","6415437","560"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quando vou às lojas, é só isso que vendem.","e":"'Cause when you look in the stores here, that's all they sell.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.723254,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f7229f9b6754ac8ecc933307169ed95a","i":"a613538480a60c3b253f6befe65429c3","r":"5280330:6983108:307:4468447","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5280330","6983108","307"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela passou o tempo passeando entre as lojas.","e":"She killed time going around the shops.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.793497,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"101be088d70f8bc5500cbdbc9be2e1ab","i":"a9f51c4c66965c3ba90abdcbc4374850","r":"998967:315924","c":"une_monica","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/998967","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/998967","b":"Tatoeba sentence #998967 by une_monica; English translation #315924 by \\N","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/998967","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Fazem ideia porque algumas lojas foram atacadas e outras não?","e":"Any idea why some shops were targeted and others were left alone?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.8011,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"3ddeb97d50718009f68c23756faa4a84","i":"91941d01446cad897b58d4f8bd4575a8","r":"4981514:6875974:180:2054216","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4981514","6875974","180"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estão por aí várias lojas que ainda não explorámos.","e":"There's tons of stores out there we haven't scavenged yet.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.824786,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"15f08b0e25a2e25d94a1bf3794f90762","i":"41895b85009863e292bb4f4b900cf5a1","r":"5212384:6748911:493:3410488","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5212384","6748911","493"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quero os nossos discos à venda em lojas para não-informáticos.","e":"I want our discs available beyond stores aimed at the computer crowd.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.769724,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"4a3ea6f81a2ec98fba4093700aa2b37d","i":"e59a7561e578e3cb57e0ca0df27454f5","r":"5539282:6910880:246:3802913","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5539282","6910880","246"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ou que possa ir a pé até as lojas para as suas necessidades diárias.","e":"Within walking distance of stores for his daily needs.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.679838,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"267f8b35dcabb281a13985c42f416f0c","i":"98ee4f75c231a307f8aed50157a57943","r":"4941872:6368075:576:2012903","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4941872","6368075","576"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Hoje é feriado! Por isso todas as lojas estão fechadas.","e":"Today's a bank holiday! That's why all shops are closed.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.881265,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"29abbde39e4079b1d091cdb9b651e5cf","i":"adac0828373ea2a07617aadbd43854df","r":"8835973:9283122","c":"Ricardo14","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8835973","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8835973","b":"Tatoeba sentence #8835973 by Ricardo14; English translation #9283122 by Nylez","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8835973","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]}]]},"ebd6f3fd":{"m":[[{"t":"Sabias que há histórias iguais a essa, em cada um destes livros?","e":"Well, did you know that there are stories just like that in every one of these books?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.854539,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"bbd9be9440ef6280774f85e787f508dd","i":"08fa7b1e20e00db671c2e19b86742977","r":"5803094:6887550:326:4698057","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5803094","6887550","326"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu odeio as mulheres que dizem que todos os homens são iguais.","e":"I hate women who say that all men are alike.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.895119,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"dbf9fcad8525780d84ff021346e438c7","i":"7846e3a2d3e517130211dacc83b575be","r":"9288010:8395521","c":"heo598","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9288010","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9288010","b":"Tatoeba sentence #9288010 by heo598; English translation #8395521 by abburns","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9288010","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"São 12 peças destas e são iguais em todo o lado.","e":"It's a dozen of these. They are consistent in appearance across manufacturers.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.506933,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"bb481a0a26205f8e9a6a434416796c87","i":"b3691234dc0ce411e3f67fa912c749de","r":"3853924:6358542:35:633282","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3853924","6358542","35"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Todos os animais são iguais, mas alguns são mais iguais do que outros.","e":"All animals are equal, but some animals are more equal than others.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.87692,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"124c4dde024542cb3663d97547fdefb4","i":"c6020fadee50dd5bea72d337e23d0950","r":"942758:393812","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/942758","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/942758","b":"Tatoeba sentence #942758 by alexmarcelo; English translation #393812 by blay_paul","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/942758","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Cortar um bolo em pedaços iguais é bem difícil.","e":"Cutting a cake into equal pieces is rather difficult.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.878507,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a4fd4f1eca8100c8b4fbb5ee4ba781b7","i":"2a7a91d567a383849297276aa53f6768","r":"1322830:976009","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1322830","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1322830","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1322830 by alexmarcelo; English translation #976009 by CM","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1322830","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"São as pessoas que se mudam, ou então ficam iguais.","e":"People change themselves or they don't.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.763952,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"7b017e28ad092d277bc11f9e827de210","i":"50ab1875ac5faadc6737304703c4a1bf","r":"4307670:6670430:131:2658766","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4307670","6670430","131"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu sei que para vocês, nós parecemos todos iguais.","e":"I know we all look alike to you.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.903077,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"2bdb7cd00f69b8ba868e2b01bc87c328","i":"705005a9b9f4054490435e37024e87fe","r":"3781964:6107543:172:570323","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3781964","6107543","172"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estas camisas são iguais. Elas são da mesma cor.","e":"These shirts are the same. They are the same colour.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.902617,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"9173f4f47a1dc6d96c0f79d60d15087f","i":"62b6bc7ed2cbff563f6deaa8ecb18611","r":"956903:463136","c":"une_monica","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/956903","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/956903","b":"Tatoeba sentence #956903 by une_monica; English translation #463136 by lukaszpp","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/956903","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]}]]}}}